  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for the Canton Ledger API clients. AddCantonLedgerProblemDetails() answers a LedgerOperationException escaping a minimal-API or MVC endpoint with an RFC 9457 problem+json response: 409 for contention or a consumed contract, 404 for a missing resource, and 202 carrying commandId and updateId for a command that committed whose result could not be read, which the caller must not retry. ProducesLedgerProblems() declares those responses in the OpenAPI document. Depends on Canton.Ledger.Abstractions only, so it works with either transport.",
